OL,4,CRussian arrested for spying on US      
OL,5,Cdefence company Palantir over Ukraine  
OL,6,Csupport                                
OL,7,GA Russian man has been arrested in     
OL,8,GCalifornia's Silicon Valley for        
OL,9,Gallegedly attempting to spy on         
OL,10,Gemployees of a technology and defence  
OL,11,Gfirm that supports the Ukrainian       
OL,12,Gmilitary.                              
OL,14,FIgor D'iu is accused of acting as an   
OL,15,Fagent of a foreign government to       
OL,16,Fconduct a covert operation in Palo     
OL,17,FAlto, near San Francisco. The BBC      
OL,18,Funderstands that the company targeted  
OL,19,Fwas Palantir Technologies.             
